  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "This...is Café Triste.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002E002E002E00690073002000430061006600E90020005400720069007300740065002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As our name suggests, we cultivate a...subdued\natmosphere here.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100730020006F007500720020006E0061006D0065002000730075006700670065007300740073002C002000770065002000630075006C00740069007600610074006500200061002E002E002E0073007500620064007500650064000A00610074006D006F00730070006800650072006500200068006500720065002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once, years ago, we suddenly began to grow\nmuch more popular.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOur café was bursting with customers. In the end,\nwe couldn’t serve them all.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It got so busy I wanted to pull out my own hair.\nTo such overwhelming crowds, I say “non, merci!”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And yet if no customers come at all, we can’t stay\nin business. It’s a delicate balance.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see what I’m driving at, yes?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000730065006500200077006800610074002000492019006D002000640072006900760069006E0067002000610074002C0020007900650073003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re driving at something?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075201900720065002000640072006900760069006E006700200061007400200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m not a mind reader...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006E006F0074002000610020006D0069006E00640020007200650061006400650072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To attract enough customers to keep us afloat—\nyet not so many that we drown—we need to offer<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndishes that are just tempting enough!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What dish do you think would suit our menu?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006100740020006400690073006800200064006F00200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B00200077006F0075006C0064002000730075006900740020006F007500720020006D0065006E0075003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose Galettes?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0075006D0069006F00730065002000470061006C00650074007400650073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Croissants?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430072006F0069007300730061006E00740073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Curry and rice?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007500720072007900200061006E006400200072006900630065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you can get Lumiose Galettes anywhere!\nNon, merci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200079006F0075002000630061006E00200067006500740020004C0075006D0069006F00730065002000470061006C0065007400740065007300200061006E0079007700680065007200650021000A004E006F006E002C0020006D0065007200630069002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’d forever be in the shadow of Nouveau Café’s\ncroissanterie! Non, merci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And hear people grouse that it’s not as tasty as\nHotel Z’s surprisingly good curry? Non, merci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps sushi is the answer!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720068006100700073002000730075007300680069002000690073002000740068006500200061006E0073007700650072002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s pleasantly light, not too filling...but it would\nclash horribly with coffee! Perfect for attracting<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nonly a modest crowd of true enthusiasts!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quite the ingenious solution, if I do say so myself!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900740065002000740068006500200069006E00670065006E0069006F0075007300200073006F006C007500740069006F006E002C0020006900660020004900200064006F002000730061007900200073006F0020006D007900730065006C0066002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’ve never even attempted making sushi...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000492019007600650020006E00650076006500720020006500760065006E00200061007400740065006D00700074006500640020006D0061006B0069006E0067002000730075007300680069002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And a research trip to Sushi High Roller would\nbreak my meal budget. Non, merci!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis time you see what I’m driving at, don’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, I suppose you don’t...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’m asking you to show me Tatsugiri! I want to see\nthis Pokémon in all three of its fishy forms!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you got a Tatsugiri to show me? If so,\nwhich form?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200079006F007500200067006F007400200061002000540061007400730075006700690072006900200074006F002000730068006F00770020006D0065003F00200049006600200073006F002C000A0077006800690063006800200066006F0072006D003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Curly Form",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750072006C007900200046006F0072006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Droopy Form",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440072006F006F0070007900200046006F0072006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Stretchy Form",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400720065007400630068007900200046006F0072006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "None right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E00650020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excusez-moi! That is not the form you said! Did\nyou think I wouldn’t be able to tell? Non, merci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re not the type of person who would renege\non a promise, are you? Non, merci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So this is a Curly Form Tatsugiri!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSeems like it’d be hard to make food curl up like\nthat, but it’s helpful to see an example.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is helpful. I look forward to seeing all of\nTatsugiri’s forms.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000690073002000680065006C007000660075006C002E002000490020006C006F006F006B00200066006F0072007700610072006400200074006F00200073006500650069006E006700200061006C006C0020006F0066000A0054006100740073007500670069007200692019007300200066006F0072006D0073002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So this is a Droopy Form Tatsugiri!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s funny how sushi can droop like that and still\nbe appealing!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is helpful. I look forward to seeing all of\nTatsugiri’s forms.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000690073002000680065006C007000660075006C002E002000490020006C006F006F006B00200066006F0072007700610072006400200074006F00200073006500650069006E006700200061006C006C0020006F0066000A0054006100740073007500670069007200692019007300200066006F0072006D0073002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So this is a Stretchy Form Tatsugiri!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI think I can finagle something like this, as long\nas I’ve got something to balance on some rice...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is helpful. I look forward to seeing all of\nTatsugiri’s forms.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000690073002000680065006C007000660075006C002E002000490020006C006F006F006B00200066006F0072007700610072006400200074006F00200073006500650069006E006700200061006C006C0020006F0066000A0054006100740073007500670069007200692019007300200066006F0072006D0073002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I appreciate you showing me all three forms of\nTatsugiri.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006100700070007200650063006900610074006500200079006F0075002000730068006F00770069006E00670020006D006500200061006C006C00200074006800720065006500200066006F0072006D00730020006F0066000A005400610074007300750067006900720069002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think I can take a passable stab at making sushi\nnow. Give me a moment...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well? What do you think?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s obviously not made by a pro, but it looks just\ngood enough to make you curious.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Which means it should be a perfectly lukewarm\nseller for our modest-hit menu!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold up—is that for real?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020007500702014006900730020007400680061007400200066006F00720020007200650061006C003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SUSHI...with COFFEE?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530055005300480049002E002E002E007700690074006800200043004F0046004600450045003F00100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose really is gourmet central. People will try\neating all kinds of things!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I may not be the one eating it, but the world\nneeds to see this!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006D006100790020006E006F007400200062006500200074006800650020006F006E006500200065006100740069006E0067002000690074002C0020006200750074002000740068006500200077006F0072006C0064000A006E006500650064007300200074006F002000730065006500200074006800690073002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, Brenda’s Besties! I’m back with another one-\nhundred-percent authentic Lumiose food find!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This sushi-coffee combo is BLOWING my MIND\nand opening up a WHOLE NEW WORLD!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCafé Triste is on a whole new level, so come get\non it! Byeee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoops. There I go again—another impromptu\nlivestream. I just can’t stop changing the world!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is it—that sushi-coffee combo spot!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
